  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2012/302 -801 Relaunch Lot 2 &#x96; Implementation of energy-efficient retrofit measures in 18 schools across Kosovo and 2 Hospitals in Prishtina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The purpose of this works contract is implementation of building energy-efficient retrofit measure in 18 existing schools across different municipalities (Kosovo), and 2 Hospitals in Prishtina under the &apos;&apos;Design &amp; Build&apos;&apos; works contract.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
